# Orchestration

Follow the canonical standard: **`.ai/standards/orchestration.md`**

- Execution unit is `phase → selected skills`
- Optional one-shot heuristic classify (`--request` / `--size` / `--signals`) then `applies_when`
- Path router stays deterministic (skill `paths:`, `--only` / `--skip` / `--full`)
- Never call a model to decide the next phase
- `--auto` is one-shot per unit; gates still need a human
- Workflow cloud context is lean (purpose + skill + templates)
